# Authored on Windows, tested on Linux CI, and scanned literally by
# tests/test_no_network.py and tests/test_js_guard.py. Normalising to LF in the
# repository keeps line-ending churn out of diffs and out of those scans.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.mp4 binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.safetensors binary
